{"availability":"available","full":"wxsd-sales/roomos-device-widgets","name":"roomos-device-widgets","description":"An app for demoing RoomOS device capabilities in Kiosk/PWA mode.","category":"Other","language":"Svelte","stars":4,"forks":0,"created":"2022-05-04T18:45:01Z","updated":"2025-08-06T04:18:29Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://roomos-device-widgets.wbx.ninja","topics":["collaboration","integration","iot","orm","roomos","svelte","sveltejs","sveltekit","typescript"],"demo":"https://app.vidcast.io/share/bb910329-f398-4f04-baec-18ddaf46f493","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:04:29.271Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:04:29.271Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:04:29.271Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:42:56.293Z","stars":4,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T06:39:17.101Z","stars":4,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T15:04:29.271Z","stars":4,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Svelte"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An app for demoing RoomOS device capabilities in Kiosk/PWA mode.","This is a proof-of-concept application that generates customized web application links for use on a compatible RoomOS 11 device in Kiosk/PWA mode. Kiosk and PWA (Persistent Web App) are new modes that make use of the in-built Web Engine on modern RoomOS devices to display a webpage or custom-made web application on the device. As a result, developers can have full control on the integrations (using APIs and SDKs), branding, controls and UI/UX presented to the end users.","This application generates customized web application links to demos that you create. In this context, a \"demo\" is a collection of widgets (brand logo, background, sensors etc.) that make up the UI/controls of a PWA/Kiosk device. You can create multiple demos and activate them on a compatible device of your choice after logging-in. Once activated, the application uses cloud xAPI requests with a Webex Bot token to control the device (make calls, get room analytics data, etc.)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wxsd-sales/roomos-device-widgets/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bd0f638d0b5eb4496ab3a79c8c8c3b9bf4ea3b8486ea5b4f87aaa9a3899a4d9b","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:56.514Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:56.514Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An app for demoing RoomOS device capabilities in Kiosk/PWA mode.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wxsd-sales/roomos-device-widgets/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"bd0f638d0b5eb4496ab3a79c8c8c3b9bf4ea3b8486ea5b4f87aaa9a3899a4d9b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wxsd-sales/roomos-device-widgets/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:56.514Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-08-06T04:18:29Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wxsd-sales/roomos-device-widgets/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:56.515Z","hash":"bd0f638d0b5eb4496ab3a79c8c8c3b9bf4ea3b8486ea5b4f87aaa9a3899a4d9b","originalBytes":5146,"storedBytes":5146,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["webex","device","client","application","bot","env","demo","follow","roomos","these","web","code","devices","environment","file","kiosk","pwa","setup","variables","access","assign","compatible","control","guide.","make","note","overview","read","respectively.","review","spark","support","take","values","within","wxsd","api","app","ashessin","authorization","cisco.com","clone","content","controls","create","customized","demos","description","device.","directory","encrypted","env.example","etc.","external.cisco.com","following","generates","instructions","integration","interact","kms","links","mode.","must","new","organization","permission","redirect","registering","registration","rest","scope","scopes","secret","secret.","spark-admin","token","using","widgets","activate","activated","administrator","after","analytics","any","apis","assume","available","azure","background","below","brand","branding","br